lk arm. Anchor: `Kind::Select { source, pred, .. } => {\\n                self.walk(source);\\n                self.walk(pred);\\n            }` — multi-line, spaces. This might fail too. Use single-line anchor: the line `            Kind::Select { source, pred, .. } => {` — begins with 12 spaces. Risky. Use mid-anchor: `pred, .. } => {` is ambiguous? Probably unique-ish. Let me use:\n\noldString: `            Kind::Select { source, pred, .. } => {`  — if spaces match it works; if not, fails and I fall back.\n\n Try it.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_068ea0715001pXdljft3lS08FQ","sessionID":"ses_f971d285effeq84jbpOgeGh3gS","messageID":"msg_068e9e83f001hG7jNNWcJBnVaE"}}
